      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When a muckish creep Strides or Steps, it leaves behind a slimy mud trail that coats the traversed area. All traversed squares are covered in grease (DC 26) until the start of the muckish creep's next turn."
      ]
    },
